# Date picker convention

Do **not** use raw `<input type="date" />` in the PSE frontend.

Use the shared component instead:

```tsx
import { DatePickerField } from './components/DatePickerField';
// or from '../components/DatePickerField' depending on file location

<DatePickerField
  value={someDate}
  onChange={setSomeDate}
  title="选择截止日"
/>
```

- Styles live in `App.css` under `.date-picker-field*`.
- Component: `frontend/src/components/DatePickerField.tsx`.
- Rationale: native calendar indicators are hard to see/click in dark theme; the shared control hides them and exposes an explicit calendar button with `showPicker()`.

When adding a new date field, reuse `DatePickerField`. Do not copy-paste the markup again.
